      ],
      "source": "https://scenic4.org/the-route/points-of-interest/dorrington/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dorrington hosts the second‑largest Sugar Pine in the world, 220 feet tall and 32 feet in circumference.",
